{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CfcTSMN63FZwaWHFvP8SY", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "`git rebase --onto` lets you choose exactly which commits to move and where to put them. A plain `git rebase` only lets you pick the destination.\n\n### Syntax\n\n```\ngit rebase --onto <newbase> <upstream> [<branch>]\n```\n\nGit takes the commits that are in `<branch>` but not in `<upstream>`, which is the range `upstream..branch`, and replays them on top of `<newbase>`. `<upstream>` is exclusive: commits up to and including it are left behind. If you leave out `<branch>`, it uses the current branch.\n\n### Example: move a branch off another feature branch\n\nYou branched `feature-b` off `feature-a`, but `feature-b` doesn't actually depend on `feature-a`. You want it based on `main`:\n\n```\nmain:       A---B\n                 \\\nfeature-a:        C---D\n                       \\\nfeature-b:              E---F\n```\n\n```bash\ngit rebase --onto main feature-a feature-b\n```\n\nThis means: take the commits in `feature-b` that aren't in `feature-a` (E and F) and replay them onto `main`:\n\n```\nmain:       A---B\n                |\\\nfeature-a:      | C---D\n                 \\\nfeature-b:        E'---F'\n```\n\nC and D stay on `feature-a` only. A plain `git rebase main` run from `feature-b` would have carried them along too.\n\n### Another common use: dropping commits\n\nTo remove commits from the middle of a branch, for example dropping C and D from `A-B-C-D-E` (with E as HEAD):\n\n```bash\ngit rebase --onto B D\n```\n\nThis replays everything after D (just E) onto B, giving `A-B-E'`.\n\nThe replayed commits get new hashes. If the branch was already pushed, you'll need to `git push --force-with-lease`."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 7600, "cache_read_input_tokens": 16975, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 7600}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "not_available"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "1c3c1151-1e9f-4aae-8a56-97924834a37e", "uuid": "b975e0ca-aad4-4074-a49d-0168dee19362", "timestamp": "2026-10-02T00:23:00.261Z", "request_id": "req_011CfcTSM8CY5Nb28SGdUmp1"}
